  "details": "Ok, I'm experience a bug with 3.0 avatars.  When I trigger an animation from an emote or AFK I vanish and my name tag is not visible.  Nobody can hear me but I can see and hear everybody.  I can reproduce this at will.  I also found another person with a 3.0 avatar also having this problem  with a different 3.0 avatar.  In one test some people in the room could still see me but most didn't.\n\nThey can still find my bubble and show avatar and I come back but my name tag is gone and the bubble is hard to find. \n\nHALP!",
